{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/4cbe6d9604ceb8498dc48c489ec34501.avif?t=1773422187\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar Findings is a charming and cozy idle game with a magical twist. Join Avia, an aspiring mythozoologist, as she seeks to write and complete a magical grimoire of witches\u2019 familiars. Summon familiars, collect their mana and complete fusion spells to discover new combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleeping Elder Dragons, grumpy ghosts and elegant capycorns are just some of the many familiars that wander and rest at the bottom of your screen. Try new fusion combinations to discover exclusive colour variants and higher rarities. Click on them to interact, each type has its own unique animations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/2b1ef6d2ad1086dc7947136a16b075aa.poster.avif?t=1773422187\" width=702 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/2b1ef6d2ad1086dc7947136a16b075aa.webm?t=1773422187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/2b1ef6d2ad1086dc7947136a16b075aa.mp4?t=1773422187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your new desktop companions will keep you company while you do other things, whether that\u2019s streaming, writing assignments or getting lost in internet rabbit holes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete your codex</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new discovery aids you in your research and brings you one page closer in completing your grimoire. Learn new facts about your familiars, track your progress and read Avia\u2019s notes and musings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/65c0717f5e866057705d504352b1d009.avif?t=1773422187\" width=1079 height=697 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play that doesn't get in your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your familiars live at the bottom of your screen, but they won't stop you from being able to use any of your desktop! Your menu is tucked away when you\u2019re not using it to give you a streamlined experience. There\u2019s no distracting notifications or demanding grind mechanics that ruin your relaxation. Click and drag to move a familiar out of the way or scroll on Avia to quickly size everything up and down. Toggle reduced opacity mode to make it even easier to see what's going on behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/b241eb157cb864b018e15b5c49b1e4c8.poster.avif?t=1773422187\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=734 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/b241eb157cb864b018e15b5c49b1e4c8.webm?t=1773422187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/extras/b241eb157cb864b018e15b5c49b1e4c8.mp4?t=1773422187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Can I...?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3914780/33337d119ccc19e