atisfying kind of magic.\u201d<br>Indie Insights<br><br>\u201cThe captivating style, filled with adorable familiars, turns a casual game into a lively experience that brings the desktop to life.\u201d<br>Watermelo<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/0e18b6802b730798aa61411d3dde7ac7d7b1acbc/ss_0e18b6802b730798aa61411d3dde7ac7d7b1acbc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773422187","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/0e18b6802b730798aa61411d3dde7ac7d7b1acbc/ss_0e18b6802b730798aa61411d3dde7ac7d7b1acbc.600x338.jpg?t=1773422187"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/35ddd2a0a5f2b1ca083df28229a9045c9a9fbdb6/ss_35ddd2a0a5f2b1ca083df28229a9045c9a9fbdb6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773422187","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/35ddd2a0a5f2b1ca083df28229a9045c9a9fbdb6/ss_35ddd2a0a5f2b1ca083df28229a9045c9a9fbdb6.600x338.jpg?t=1773422187"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/beb66d9592d7f988dbdfd2f6a95689815d589b49/ss_beb66d9592d7f988dbdfd2f6a95689815d589b49.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773422187","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/beb66d9592d7f988dbdfd2f6a95689815d589b49/ss_beb66d9592d7f988dbdfd2f6a95689815d589b49.600x338.jpg?t=1773422187"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/aaa0eea2dbcda8d7fd21aa3e1cb0ab6642455c87/ss_aaa0eea2dbcda8d7fd21aa3e1cb0ab6642455c87.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773422187","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/aaa0eea2dbcda8d7fd21aa3e1cb0ab6642455c87/ss_aaa0eea2dbcda8d7fd21aa3e1cb0ab6642455c87.600x338.jpg?t=1773422187"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914780/e0ace1ad3c0e2f